==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
Hinox Toenails are [[Monster Part]]s that are dropped by all types of [[Hinox]]es when they're killed. They're as thick as a plate of armor and can be [[Cooking|cooked]] with critters in a [[Cooking Pot]] to make [[Elixir]]s.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> Alternatively, they can be sold to [[Kilton]] at the [[Fang and Bone]] for [[Mon]] or used as an ingredient for [[Brown Dye]] at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]].

Each piece of the [[Fierce Deity Set]] requires five Hinox Toenails, as well as a dragon scale, to be upgraded to their first tier by a [[Great Fairy]].
